.TH "AIU_SHELL_JUMP" "1" "2021-04-12" "" "aiu-shell-jump"
.SH NAME
\fBaiu-shell-jump-remove\fR - remove a directory from the database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aiu-shell-jump remove [PATHS] [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
If you'd like to permanently exclude a directory from the database, see the
\fB_ZO_EXCLUDE_DIRS\fR environment variable in \fBaiu-shell-jump\fR(1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print help information.
